WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:02.690
Hey, Micchan...

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:04.650
When are you gonna do your homework?

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.570
If you don't finish, you won't get any snacks.

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:14.360
I know. I'm gonna do it.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:16.030
Ah! An itch!

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.200
My back itches! Chi-chan, scratch it!

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:20.660
Scratch it yourself.

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:23.920
I can't reach it! Hurry!

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:30.010
Around here?

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:31.130
Where is it?

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:33.180
No, lower.

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:35.300
Here?

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:36.550
A little lower.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:37.600
Here?

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.600
Over to the left.

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:41.390
Ah, right there.

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:42.640
You can reach that!

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:44.810
Um, Chika-san...

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.770
I don't understand this part.

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.020
Oh? Where?

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:48.650
This question here.

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:50.860
Hey, what gives? You're going to leave me hanging?

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:52.240
Forget about it already.

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:53.280
So tired...
Forget about it already.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:53.950
So tired...

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:55.660
Then you scratch my back, Onee-chan.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:56.870
No freakin' way.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:00.120
Draw an equilateral pentagon.

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:02.080
Make the size of each angle...

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:04.330
Fine, I'll just scratch it myself.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:06.250
See, I knew you could reach it!

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.380
Ah! What should I do?
It's all right! I'll get a dish towel.

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:10.130
Micchan, grab some tissues for now.

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:10.800
I got it!
Micchan, grab some tissues for now.

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:14.300
Who told you to blow your nose?!

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:16.380
There, it's fine now.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:17.510
Y–Yeah...

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:19.550
I'm sorry, Chika-chan.

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:20.970
Don't worry about it.

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:22.720
A short performance!

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:29.150
Cauliflower ears.

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:30.690
What were those tissues for?!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:34.950
See? This angle ends up being 54 degrees, so then you double it.

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:36.110
Oh, I see!

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:37.610
I understand now!

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:39.120
You're almost done, huh?

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:40.490
So, is it snack time yet?

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:42.330
You haven't done any work!

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:44.330
Man, I'm hungry.

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:46.460
Don't you have homework too?

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:48.460
You have a report coming up, right?

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:49.330
Do I?

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:51.040
You mean you don't even know?!

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:54.090
I give up.

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:55.050
There's no point even trying.

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:57.880
Honestly, that's Nobue onee-chan for you, huh?

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:01.010
Take those out!

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:04.640
banzai! nanda sou nano ka!
Hurray! So that's how it is!

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:10.560
sorasora aozora miageta
I looked up at the dazzling blue sky

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:21.780
saru ga ki kara ochiru kobuta mo ki ni noboru
A monkey fell from a tree and a piglet climbed up it

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:25.540
yappa hen da jitabata shiteru ne
It's definitely strange how it struggles

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:28.920
kimagure na soramoyou nattenai maegami
Like the whimsical weather, my bangs are messy

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:32.420
minna matomete kakatte koi!
Everyone come at me together!

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.510
sukoshi uso wo tsuita okkina koe de waratta
I told a little lie and laughed out loud

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:40.340
sorya ne sugu ni onaka mo suku desho
But then I suddenly got hungry

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:43.930
shiawase tte naani purin yori mo amai
What is happiness? It's sweeter than pudding

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:47.180
dokka de dokka de koe ga shiteru
I hear a voice from somewhere, somewhere out there

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:54.570
ganbari sugiru hodo taishite susundenai zo
Trying too hard won't get you anywhere

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:58.320
pareedo wa okiraku ni
Parades are supposed to be lighthearted

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:02.450
imi mo nakya tsumi mo nain desu
They're meaningless, and nothing's wrong with that

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:07.660
sansei! sore ni kimemashita
Agreed! That's what we've decided

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:11.670
patapata patapata masshigura
Pattering on at full speed

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:15.340
"isshou no onegai"
Our "once-in-a-lifetime request"

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:18.590
sore tte nankaime made nee okkei okkei?
How many times must we ask before it's okay?

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:22.470
hantai! tsugi wa dou sun no?
Objection! What should we do next?

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:26.430
suicchi ga bachin to oto wo tateta
The switch clicked as it turned on

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:32.270
wakatteru you de wakannai mama mirai
We only appear to understand the future

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:35.570
shibuki tobashite sheikingu janpingu
Sending up a splash, shaking and jumping

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:37.480
ore ore
Ole ole

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.030
Onee-chan!

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:48.410
Hey, Onee-chan!

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:49.960
No Smoking
Nobue
Hey, Onee-chan!

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:53.120
Did you mess with my game again when you played it?

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:56.590
But the same scenery all the time is boring.

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:58.090
Well cut it out, all right?

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:00.340
You're so narrow minded, Chi.

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:04.300
Besides, you're supposed to be nice to people who're trying to quit smoking.

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:06.810
You'll never stick with it.

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:07.930
What?!

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.350
All right, how about a bet?

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:11.310
If you can quit smoking...

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:14.350
I'll let you use the bathroom first every day.

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:15.770
What will you bet?

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:23.860
See You Tomorrow

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:27.870
Tomorrow's Tuesday, huh?

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:31.290
Tomorrow's Tuesday, huh?

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.000
Do you have P.E. tomorrow, Micchan?

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:38.590
Do you have P.E. tomorrow, Micchan?

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:44.220
Hey, what are you doing?

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.760
Hey, what are you doing?

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:48.050
Don't copy me!

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:49.310
Don't copy me!

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:51.310
You little...

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:53.560
This is too easy.

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:14.460
Why you!

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:16.880
I'm going shopping.

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.190
Coming!

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:46.200
John! No!

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.320
Sorry to keep you—

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:56.870
Yes?

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:57.790
I'm sorry!

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:01.090
I–It's not what you think! I'm not playing a trick on you!

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:03.050
I understand.

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:12.510
Hey, Chi-chan...

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:18.350
Would you say the two of us are best friends? Or just friends?

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:22.520
What's this all of a sudden?

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:25.990
Is a best friend different from a friend?

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:28.530
Of course they're different. Probably.

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:29.740
Probably?

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:31.660
But, I guess you're right.

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:33.990
So, what is a best friend?

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.950
That's what I'm asking.

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:39.420
Okay, I'll try asking Nobue onee-chan!

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:45.000
Hey!

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.590
Quiet down.

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:48.590
Hey, Onee-chan...

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.890
You've got a piece of lint on you. A big one.

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:54.600
Huh? Really?

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:56.310
This is why you can't get a boyfriend.

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:57.350
Shut up.

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:00.690
Chi-chan, bring me some tea.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:02.310
Ask her already.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:04.650
Onee-chan, can you move?

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:05.980
I want to listen to a CD.

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:07.030
What a hassle.

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:14.280
Hey! We haven't finished our conversation from earlier!

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:17.040
Huh? It doesn't make any difference to me.

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:30.130
Hey, Onee-chan, is a best friend different from a friend?

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:32.010
Dunno.

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.850
What are you doing?

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:36.260
Texting a friend from school.

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:39.770
Onee-chan, is everything okay?

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:41.640
I do have friends, you know!

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:45.480
Oh, but that person isn't your best friend? Just a friend?

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:46.690
Huh?

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:47.860
She's my best—

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:49.320
No, wait...

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:52.740
Friend? Best friend?

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:58.240
What is a best friend?

00:07:58.240 --> 00:07:59.580
That's what I'm asking you.

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:02.790
Where are you going, Onee-chan?

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:04.290
Nowhere.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.710
Come in!

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:11.590
Sorry to bother you.

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:17.890
Matsuri-chan!

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:21.180
Ana-chan, do exactly as I say!

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:24.770
Or else, I'll write "God" on Matsuri-chan's forehead!

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:29.030
You underhanded little...

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:30.860
I understand.

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:31.950
What should I do?

00:08:31.950 --> 00:08:34.450
Pluck out your nose hairs and stick them on your eyelashes...

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:36.120
Silky!

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:38.160
How silky my lashes feel!

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:39.240
...and say that!

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:44.920
What am I to you?

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.630
Hurry up and do it!

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:50.460
H–Hold on! Make it something else!

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:51.380
What?!

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:54.130
You don't care what happens to Matsuri-chan?

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:56.800
Don't come any closer, Miu!

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:57.680
O–Onee-sama?

00:08:57.680 --> 00:08:59.220
Unhand Matsuri-chan!

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:00.470
If you don't...

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:02.680
I'll jam my fingers up Ana-chan's nose!

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:03.810
Wait, what?!

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:05.190
Go ahead.

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:10.020
Th–Then, I'll kiss Ana-chan!

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:10.570
Onee-sama?!

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:11.650
Hold it, you coward!
Onee-sama?!

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:12.490
Hold it, you coward!

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:13.280
You're evil!

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:15.740
I'm really going to write it!

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:18.580
What the heck are you guys doing?!

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:23.830
Well, I was testing you guys just now.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:25.210
Wh–What sort of test?

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:28.420
To see how close Ana-chan and Matsuri-chan are, right?

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.170
She did protect her.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:32.760
That's just because you got in the way.

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:34.800
Ana-chan probably wouldn't have gone through with it.

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.180
"My silky lashes!"

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:37.970
Who would do something like that?!

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.810
You didn't save Ana-chan, though.

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:43.140
I can't believe you.

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:45.270
That's because she didn't need saving.

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:48.100
This is nothing.

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:50.980
I don't want to have someone like you as a friend.

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:54.150
Thank you, Ana-chan. You protected me.

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:56.820
Well, of course I did.

00:09:57.820 --> 00:09:59.530
You two are pretty close, huh?

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:00.740
Are you best friends?

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:02.990
Yeah! We're best friends, right?

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:04.700
We sure are! Right?

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:06.410
How close are you?

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:08.210
How close?

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:12.710
We're together even at school, and we play together after we go home.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:15.470
We have matching photo stickers on our cell phones.

00:10:15.470 --> 00:10:18.220
And we text each other all the time!

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:20.890
Me and Chi-chan do that sort of thing all the time too!

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:24.100
What kind of texts do you send, anyway?

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:25.100
Show me.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.850
H–Huh?

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:29.600
Just the most recent one is fine.

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:31.310
Okay? Okay?

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.280
Sorry if you're already asleep.

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:38.490
I'm a bit nervous about tomorrow's test.

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:40.280
Will you be all right, Ana-chan?

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.990
I'm not very confident either.

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:46.830
But you've studied really hard, Matsuri-chan.

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:49.750
Believe in yourself and you'll do fine.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:51.790
Thank you!

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:54.210
Somehow, I feel much more confident now.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:55.760
Let's do our best tomorrow.

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:58.010
We can review together at school.

00:10:58.010 --> 00:10:59.220
Goodnight.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:02.680
That's side-splitting.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:03.970
Wh–What do you mean?!

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:05.390
My sides actually hurt!

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:06.640
Look at this, Onee-chan!

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:08.640
Is this what best friends are like?

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:10.650
That's so cute!

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:11.600
They really are best friends.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:15.570
All right, then look at these texts between me and Chi-chan!

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:21.820
Die in a fire
Chi-chan

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:25.080
Ribcage
Chi-chan

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:25.490
Get fractured
Chi-chan

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:28.080
Chi-chan
Get fractured

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:29.330
Um...

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:31.540
I feel sorry for Chika-san.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:32.960
What for?

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:35.800
No matter how you look at it, ours make us seem more like best friends, right?

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:36.840
Right, Onee-chan?

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:40.050
Well, theirs seem more normal.

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:43.140
Huh? Really?

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:46.260
Oh yeah, we have a language test tomorrow, don't we?

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:52.940
I'm a bit nervous about tomorrow's test.

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:54.190
Will you be all right, Chi-chan?

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:00.610
You creep
Chi-chan

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:03.070
Look, see? Like she said, it's creepy.

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:06.080
That's probably because it's from you.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:08.580
Besides, that's not all there is to being best friends.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:11.160
How far have you guys gone?

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:16.000
Me and Chi-chan have already kissed!

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:16.790
What?

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:21.170
We've even rubbed each other's boobs!

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:22.510
It was a long time ago, though.

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:25.510
So, Onee-chan, doesn't that make us best friends?

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:27.970
No, that makes you...

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:29.850
Chi-chan, Chi-chan!

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:33.310
We're liable to be lesbians!

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:34.190
What?!

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:36.440
Stop bothering me.

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:38.440
What's "liable to be lesbians" mean?
Stop bothering me.

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:40.990
You don't need to know what that means, Matsuri-chan.

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:43.110
By the way...

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:43.990
What about me?

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:48.160
What am I to you guys? What sort of relationship?

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:51.790
More than a friend or best friend...

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:53.620
You're like our boss.

00:12:58.420 --> 00:12:59.420
Hm, I dunno...
You're kind of like my boss?
Aiko

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:00.420
A boss?

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:02.300
Hm, I dunno...
You're kind of like my boss?
Aiko

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:04.430
So that's how it is, huh?

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:07.090
I guess I don't have a best friend.

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:10.930
Um, Onee-chan, you're best friends with us, though!

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:14.520
That's nice, but our ages are too far apart.

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:17.520
I–It's true that our ages are different, but...

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:20.610
I'm starting to get sleepy now.

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:26.320
I don't really understand what you mean about our ages, but I love you, Onee-chan!

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:28.240
I love you too!

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:30.540
Please cheer up, Onee-sama.

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:32.250
I love you!

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.040
I love you!

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:36.620
I'll be fine as long as I have these two!

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:38.210
You bounced back awfully fast.

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:40.460
You and Chi are best friends too, right?

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:41.750
In some ways...

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:43.010
You're wrong!

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:45.720
We're way closer than Ana-chan and Matsuri-chan!

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:48.640
What are you getting so worked up for?

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:50.220
Then...

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:53.100
Say Ana-chan has fallen seriously ill.

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:55.940
This is just for example.

00:13:56.390 --> 00:14:00.650
If she doesn't get a transplant from someone, she'll die.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:03.990
So, what would you do, Matsuri-chan?

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:07.450
I–If I did it, what would happen to me?

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:10.410
Well, you wouldn't die.

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:12.910
Then, of course, I'd do it.

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:14.250
Thank you so—

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:15.200
Huh?

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:18.370
I don't want you to die, Ana-chan!

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:20.540
No, like she said, that was just an example.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.750
There, there, don't cry.

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:26.720
If the time came, I'd do the same for you too.

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:30.970
Thank you, Ana-chan.

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:32.890
Chi-chan, Chi-chan!

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:35.980
What is it now?

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:36.980
Give me one of your organs!

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:37.940
What?!

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:41.360
She left too much out.

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:43.610
Fine, I'll just listen to it tonight.

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:45.570
You've got it wrong, Chi-chan!

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:51.410
It's like if I were to get sick, but a transplant would save me.

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:53.660
Huh? What's this about?

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:54.870
What would you do?

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.870
If I did it, what would happen to me?

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:01.290
You wouldn't die.

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:10.050
Then, I guess I'd do it.

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:11.180
Really?!

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:12.800
Thank you, Chi-chan!

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:13.890
I love you! I really love you!

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:14.760
Yeah, yeah...
I love you! I really love you!

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:20.190
Um... It seems like you and Chika-chan really are close.

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:21.850
You complement one another.

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:25.360
The two of you really understand each other. I'm jealous.

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:27.320
I told you so!

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:31.660
See? You and me are best friends like no one else!

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:34.240
Okay, I get it. Anyway...

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:36.990
I won't be giving you any organs, though.

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.000
Give me one!

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:53.840
Thank you for your hospitality!

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:55.810
H–How do...

00:15:55.810 --> 00:15:57.850
D–Disappear conbu?

00:15:58.220 --> 00:15:59.230
Comple...

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:00.850
C–Completely.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:02.350
That's right!

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:04.610
This is dull.

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:05.690
Huh?

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:08.570
You guys are so dull!

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:13.610
You're all so young, but you just follow the same pattern day after day!

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:16.740
You also come in through the window every day.

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:18.410
What's with you guys always doing the same, boring things?

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:20.370
She ignored me.
What's with you guys always doing the same, boring things?

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:25.380
Here's my impression of Chi-chan!

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:29.170
Micchan, you ate my pudding, didn't you?!

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:32.430
I hate you, Micchan! Go away!

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:35.050
Go to sleep on your own!

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:40.430
You're always like that.

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:42.810
Thanks to you.

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:44.060
Next is Matsuri-chan.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.020
Lend me your glasses.

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:47.860
O–Okay.

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:50.860
My impression of Matsuri-chan.

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:53.650
Please stop, Miu-chan!

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:57.620
Onee-chan, hold me!

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.080
Like that, don't you think?

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:04.960
Whatever, but it's still your fault.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:07.790
Miu-chan, give me my glasses back.

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:10.130
Ah, thanks.

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:12.920
These aren't my glasses!

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:15.300
Next, I'll do my impression of Ana-chan.
These aren't my glasses!

00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:22.520
I'm so freaking hungry!

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:24.890
Impersonating Ana-chan is exhausting.

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:26.810
You're so full of it!

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:28.150
Now for a quiz.

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:30.360
Who do you think this is?

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:33.900
Hi there, I'm an idiot!

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:35.950
I'm an old lady that loves cute little girls!

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:37.280
I know! It's Nobu-nee!

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:41.290
Just what are you trying to say, huh?

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:42.750
W–Well, basically...

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:46.710
Just as a caterpillar turns into a butterfly, and Satake turns into a tiger,

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:46.960
No, Satake is a dog.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:50.250
we're going to become middle schoolers, right?

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:54.760
I think you guys need to start preparing yourselves for that day.

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:56.180
Middle school students?

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:57.470
Junior high school.

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:59.680
Don't say things like that, Miu!

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:02.770
Matsuri-chan and Ana-chan are going to be grade schoolers forever!

00:18:02.770 --> 00:18:04.980
You have to let them go eventually.

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:08.730
But you're asking her to prepare herself too suddenly.

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:09.730
You're right.

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:12.980
All right, let's try it another way.

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:19.530
Nothing says middle school like a sailor uniform!

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:21.740
These should really liven things up!

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:24.540
Hey, aren't I too old to be wearing this?

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:25.000
Huh?

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:27.460
Why'd you put one on too?

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:30.000
Sh–Shut up. Is that a problem?

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.460
Not at all.

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:36.590
When we get to middle school, we'll be going to school in these uniforms.

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:38.470
It's a bit embarrassing.

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:41.010
So? What are we going to do with these?

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:43.310
Huh? I just wanted to try wearing them.

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:43.930
Hey...

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:46.390
Okay then, we'll use this.

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:50.150
Let's take a look at the world where we've graduated from grade school.

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:52.650
Can we really see it?

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:54.440
Just leave it to me.

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:56.070
Oh great lords of the sailor uniform...

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:59.110
You're pushing this in more ways than one.
Oh great lords of the sailor uniform...

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:02.740
I can see it.

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:05.200
The world where we've become middle school students.

00:19:19.430 --> 00:19:21.590
Micchan?

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:25.510
I left without you

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:30.020
I'm gonna be late!

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:32.690
Second year Itou Chika.

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:33.480
By now, she's able to walk across rooftops.

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:34.980
2nd Year          Itou Chika

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.730
It seems she still doesn't have much going for her.

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:39.490
W–Wait up, Chika-chan!

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:42.160
Sakuragi Matsuri, a fail—
6th Grade   Sakuragi Matsuri

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:42.990
6th Grade   Sakuragi Matsuri

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:46.490
I mean, for reasons I can't say, she's still a sixth grader.

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:48.250
Good morning, Matsuri-chan.

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:50.750
You're so slow, Chi-chan, Peewee.

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:56.710
S–Stop calling me that!

00:19:57.170 --> 00:20:00.670
Still sleeping in? You're such a slacker, Chi-chan.

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:04.760
But it's because you didn't wake me up.

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:06.970
You shouldn't rely on me all the time.

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:10.980
Come on, don't be like that.

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:14.190
At least I'm still as awesome as ever.

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:17.730
Meibundou Girls' Middle School

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:22.660
It's Coppola-san!

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:24.820
Shh! She'll hear you!

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:31.330
First year Ana Coppola black custom.

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:34.790
She's now a delinquent girl who skips class.

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:41.090
Ana-chan...

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:42.970
I wonder...

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:46.510
Have you learned how to say this yet?

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:49.470
G–Ginga ale.

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:53.690
It's pronounced "ginger ale."

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:56.940
Founding Principal

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:00.900
God damn!

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:03.400
Ana-chan!

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:06.820
She didn't make it to class today either.

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:09.120
She must be trying to set a record for truancy.

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:13.620
At least I'm still as cute as ever.

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:19.420
Satake grew into a splendid tiger.

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:21.630
And as for Nobue onee-chan...

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:23.880
It's Miu-chan!

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:26.300
Miu-chan!

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:29.600
Good girl. Did you miss me?

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:32.520
You're so cute, Miu-chan. I love you!

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:35.390
Ana-chan and the others managed to overcome their grief,

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:39.230
but one person decided to begin a new life as my pet.

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:43.690
And the town remains peaceful for yet another day.

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:50.990
These cookies are delicious!

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:52.240
They are, aren't they?

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:53.750
That's Chika-chan for you.

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:56.580
There's more if you want seconds.

00:22:03.260 --> 00:22:04.970
Seriously?

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:10.180
And after I saved up all my money too...

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:12.470
I almost made it.

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:15.680
They just had to buy it before pay day, didn't they?

00:22:30.120 --> 00:22:31.620
Onee-chan!

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:35.950
Take a look! There's an event at the beach starting today.

00:22:35.950 --> 00:22:37.660
That's so boring.

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:40.130
Do some battles or something.

00:22:40.130 --> 00:22:42.000
This isn't that kind of game.

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:44.880
Huh?

00:22:47.090 --> 00:22:50.180
I caught you! I caught you smoking!

00:22:50.180 --> 00:22:52.350
Just one is fine, isn't it?

00:22:52.350 --> 00:22:54.680
One isn't going to kill me.

00:22:54.680 --> 00:22:57.060
Don't try to talk your way out of it!

00:22:57.060 --> 00:23:00.270
But more importantly, don't try to say you forgot your promise.

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:02.310
What promise is that?

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:04.110
Oh, that?

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:05.030
You wanna go?

00:23:05.030 --> 00:23:07.860
Huh? You mean right now?

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:13.660
I think I filled up the gas last week.

00:23:14.990 --> 00:23:17.830
Hey Dad, can I borrow the car?

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:18.750
What's going on?

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:22.380
We have to let everyone know!

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:24.340
Matsuri-chan's cell

00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:28.300
Ah, hello, Matsuri-chan?

00:23:28.300 --> 00:23:31.300
I know this is sudden, but...

00:23:31.300 --> 00:23:32.300
Really?

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:34.640
Yeah. I'll invite Ana-chan too.

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:38.060
Everyone's meeting at Chika-san's house? I'll be right over!

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:04.290
It won't light.

00:24:04.290 --> 00:24:06.500
if you lose our bet!
You'll take us to the beach
Promise

00:24:26.570 --> 00:24:29.360
The beach! The beach!

00:24:29.360 --> 00:24:32.240
The beach, the beach! The beach!

00:24:39.200 --> 00:24:40.410
The beach!

00:24:45.040 --> 00:24:46.710
Onee-chan!

00:24:46.710 --> 00:24:47.540
Onee-sama!

00:24:47.540 --> 00:24:48.920
Look at this!
Onee-sama!

00:24:48.920 --> 00:24:49.670
Onee-chan!
Look at this!

00:24:49.670 --> 00:24:50.760
Onee-chan!

00:24:50.760 --> 00:24:52.880
See, we found some really interesting shells.

00:24:52.880 --> 00:24:54.010
It's clear on the bottom!

00:24:54.010 --> 00:24:56.260
There's lots of them!

00:24:56.260 --> 00:24:58.220
I found a crab!

00:24:58.220 --> 00:24:58.850
A crab?

00:24:58.850 --> 00:24:59.520
Where?

00:24:59.520 --> 00:25:00.970
Where is it?

00:25:10.650 --> 00:25:12.530
You guys never get tired of this, huh?

00:25:12.530 --> 00:25:13.320
What?

00:25:13.320 --> 00:25:16.660
The same waves keep breaking on the shore.

00:25:16.660 --> 00:25:19.540
There aren't any big waves to make things more interesting.

00:25:23.710 --> 00:25:25.120
So cold!

00:25:26.750 --> 00:25:28.380
You got your pants all wet!

00:25:28.380 --> 00:25:30.090
You totally soaked them!

00:25:30.090 --> 00:25:33.130
Dad'll be mad if you get the car seats wet!

00:25:33.130 --> 00:25:35.720
Aren't you too old to be wetting your pants?

00:25:35.720 --> 00:25:37.180
Why you...

00:25:44.890 --> 00:25:51.020
owaranai owarinai
Never-ending, it never ends

00:25:52.570 --> 00:25:58.530
kokyuu no rifurein
The refrain of my breath

00:26:00.200 --> 00:26:06.500
suikomu hakidasu
Inhaling, exhaling

00:26:08.040 --> 00:26:15.550
karappo nanka kimochi ii
The emptiness feels kind of nice

00:26:17.050 --> 00:26:21.930
yappari ima ga suki
This moment is precious after all

00:26:24.520 --> 00:26:30.650
pokari to kuchi wo aketa mama de
With my mouth opened slightly

00:26:30.650 --> 00:26:37.110
ichi byou ichi byou...
For just a second, just a second

00:26:37.110 --> 00:26:45.080
shiroi kumo wo te ni iretakute
I wanted to grasp the white clouds in my hands

00:26:45.080 --> 00:26:52.790
ano sora ni ryoute wo nobashita yo
So I reached for the sky

00:26:52.790 --> 00:27:00.970
oitekibori mitai sore mo ureshii
But I was happy even as they seemed to leave me behind

00:27:00.970 --> 00:27:07.640
koko de zutto zutto
I'll stay here forever, forever

00:27:07.640 --> 00:27:09.850
asonderu
Playing
